{title: Allahu Akbar}
{artist: Shafqat Amanat Ali Coke Studio}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Ya karim o [Bm]ya ghaffar o [Am]rahim o azim [Em]o sari ur-raza
[F]Uspe hi [G]raazi rahun jo [C]kiya tu [Am]ne mujhko aata
[Dm]Yeh jo [G]nadaamat ki maala [C]hai mere [Am]gale men pari
[G]Tasbeeh is [Am]ko bana [Gbm]de ilaahi
[Dm]Tasbeeh is [Em]ko bana [Am]de ilaahi
[Dm]Tasbeeh is [G]ko bana [C]de ilaahi
[C]Allahuma [Bm]inni asalluka [Em]birahmatika [F]Ya zul-jalal
[F]Apne kiye pih [G]zukaye hun sar [Em]dilme ranj-o malal
[Dm]Tu jo [G]sune nah [C]sunaunga kisko [Am]yeh fariyad main
[Em]Tu [Am]hi sami [Gbm]ul-baseer ul-mujeeb
[Dm]Tu [G]hi sami [Am]ul-baseer ul-mujeeb
[Dm]Tu [G]hi sami [Am]ul-baseer ul-mujeeb
[Am]Rabbe azaan-e [G]bilaali bhi tu
[Am]Arham bhi tu [G]aur jalaali bhi tu
[G]Kun fayakun [C]ka bhi [Am]khaaliq hai tu
[Am]Tu [F]rabb-e mustafa
(Allahu akbar),        [G] [Am]
Tu rabbe murteza,        (Allahu akbar)
[F]Rabbe [Bm]siraat-I [G]mustaqeem
(Allahu akbar),        [G] [Am]
Tu rabbe kaa?bah,        (Allaahu akbar)
[Am]Nooh [Dm]ki kashti
[G]ko [F]dekhta hoon
[F]Hauze [Bm]nadaamat men [G]dooba [Am]hua hoon
[C]Ya [Dm]raheem
(Kar de tu mujh ko qurbat aata),        [Em] [G]
Ya kareem,        (Dar-guzar kar de meri khata)
[Dm]Ya raheem
(Rahmat ka teri talab-gaar hoon),        [Am] [G] [C]
Ya kareem,        (Bandah main tera gunaah-gaar hoon)
[C]Darya-e aatish men ham
[Em]bas yoonhi [C]jal jaayenge
[Em]?Gar tu [C]sahaara bane
[Em]ya rabb [C]sambhal jaayenge
[G]Tu hi to [Am]wuh raushani hai kih
[C]jis se [F]main ghaafil huwa
[C]Jaane anjaane [Bm]gunaahon se
[F]kuch bhi nah haasil huwa
[F]Ho teri nazr-e karam to
[Am]yeh mushkil bhi tal jayegi
[Dm]Tu [G]hi lateef [Am]ul-khabeer ul-haleem
[F]Tu [G]hi lateef [Am]ul-khabeer ul-haleem
[Am]Rabb-e deewaar-I [G]z?ul-qarnain tu
[Am]Rabb-e mai?raaj-I [G]kaunain tu
[G]Rabb-e ismaa?eel [C]o zam-zam [Am]bhi tu
[Am]Tu rabb-e [Dm]ibraaheem( Allahhu akbar)
[G]Tu rabb-e [Am]jibraaeel( Allahhu akbar)
[F]Rabb-e [Bm]malaaika(Allahu akbar)
[G]Tu rabb-I [Am]kausar( Allahu akbar)
[Am]Apne [G]ghulaamon ki [C]de ghulaami
[F]Ya [Bm]mutakGbir ya [G]mughni [Am]ya mughni
[Am]Roz-e [F]hashr ka [Am]andaazah naheen
[Am]Bakhshish [C]ka [F]saamaan [Am]laaya [Em]naheen
[Dm]Hai meri [G]iltija, karde [Am]qurbat aata
[Dm]Karde rehm-o-karam,
[Em]miskeen hai tere [C]dar pih khada
[Bm]Mere iraade jo toote to mujhko
[F]Pata yeh chala
[C]Teri hukoomat men hoga wahi bas jo
[F]Tu [C]ne kaha.
